OL,3,CLittler warns he can still get better
OL,4,Cafter retaining World Matchplay title
OL,6,FDarts sensation Luke Littler warned he
OL,7,Fcan still get better after crushing
OL,8,FGerwyn Price 18-9 to retain his
OL,9,FBetfred World Matchplay title.
OL,11,FLittler was in imperious form as he
OL,12,Fset a new record for the final with an
OL,13,Faverage of 111.53, lifting his average
OL,14,Ffor the tournament in Blackpool as a
OL,15,Fwhole to 111.04 to break Phil Taylor's
OL,16,Fprevious high mark of 106.31.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
