OL,3,CLittler warns he can still get better
OL,4,Cafter retaining World Matchplay title
OL,6,F"I can still get better," Littler
OL,7,Fsaid. "I can get a lot better. Through
OL,8,Fthe matches, I was up to a 120 average
OL,9,Fat one point and I didn't make it
OL,10,Fstick. Maybe in a few years' time I
OL,11,Fwill stick it and go up to a 120
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,14,F"At the minute I'm playing some of the
OL,15,Fbest stuff and I've just got to keep
OL,16,Fit there...The main goal was to win
OL,17,Fevery major once. "
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@YO]oD@GOUvD@AOU
