PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F366A1786382335
OL,3,CLittler warns he can still get better
OL,4,Cafter retaining World Matchplay title
OL,6,F"I've come out with the best outcome
OL,7,Fthere is in any tournament by lifting
OL,8,Fthe trophy, but the way I've done it,
OL,9,FI've definitely surprised myself but
OL,10,Fit's down to the commitment I've got.
OL,12,F"I wanted to win this trophy more than
OL,13,Fanything, go back to back, put my name
OL,14,Fon that list and that's what I've
OL,15,Fdone. I wasn't playing the best (in
OL,16,Fthe World Series) but I've come here
OL,17,Fwith a different mindset."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@ZO]
