OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F366A1786382335
OL,3,CLittler warns he can still get better
OL,4,Cafter retaining World Matchplay title
OL,6,FPrice, appearing in his first final
OL,7,Fsince 2022 having never won the
OL,8,Ftrophy, had said earlier in the week
OL,9,Fthat if he brought his best to the
OL,10,Ffinal he could beat Littler, but it
OL,11,Fwas not the case as, even averaging
OL,12,F104.97, the Welshman was blown away.
OL,14,F"Luke is one in a million," Price
OL,15,Fsaid. "I think I played pretty decent."
